<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20469" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βότρυς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span> (heterocl. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βότρυα, τά</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Euph.
			149
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bunch of grapes</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλανες δ᾽ ἀνὰ βότρυες ἦσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.562
				</span></i>
			, etc.: pl., <i>grapes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.55
			</span></i>: prov., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βότρυς πρὸς βότρυν πεπαίνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					7.225b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			= sq. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βότρυς κόμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.286
				</span></i>
			(<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.528
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>clustered ear-ring</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				320.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμβροσία</span>
			 and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτεμισία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.114
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>oak of Jerusalem, Chenopodium Botrys</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				115
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>the Pleiades</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.486
			</span></i>.</div>
